    "title": "rqt_graph command in tutorial requires full ros2 run invocation",
    "url": "https://github.com/ros2/ros2/issues/1717",
    "body": "\nOriginal in the tutorial\n`$ rqt_graph`\n\nSuggested\n`$ ros2 run rqt_graph rqt_graph`\n\nIt appears running rqt_graph alone still fails, and not treated as a global command from sourcing alone.\n\nI've included the below lines in my ~/.bashrc and have opened a fresh terminal.\n```\nsource /opt/ros/kilted/setup.bash\nsource ~/ros2_ws/install/setup.bash\n```\n\nSystem details:\nUbuntu 24.04 Noble\nROS 2: Kilted\n\nFull Link - https://docs.ros.org/en/kilted/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Understanding-ROS2-Topics/Understanding-ROS2-Topics.html#rqt-graph",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Original in the tutorial<br>\n<code class=\"notranslate\">$ rqt_graph</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Suggested<br>\n<code class=\"notranslate\">$ ros2 run rqt_graph rqt_graph</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It appears running rqt_graph alone still fails, and not treated as a global command from sourcing alone.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I've included the below lines in my ~/.bashrc and have opened a fresh terminal.</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"source /opt/ros/kilted/setup.bash\nsource ~/ros2_ws/install/setup.bash\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">source /opt/ros/kilted/setup.bash\nsource ~/ros2_ws/install/setup.bash\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">System details:<br>\nUbuntu 24.04 Noble<br>\nROS 2: Kilted</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Full Link - <a href=\"https://docs.ros.org/en/kilted/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Understanding-ROS2-Topics/Understanding-ROS2-Topics.html#rqt-graph\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.ros.org/en/kilted/Tutorials/Beginner-CLI-Tools/Understanding-ROS2-Topics/Understanding-ROS2-Topics.html#rqt-graph</a></p>",
